The '''Time-Torn Isles''' is a [[Location]] within {{Zone|The Mountaintop}} of the [[Rift Dimension]]. It serves as a parkour trial leading to an {{Item|Enigma Soul}}.

== Purpose ==
The '''Time-Torn Isles''' can be accessed from the middle of {{Zone|The Mountaintop}}. At the starting point, a [[Fleespook]] can be found, which leads the player to several stationary platforms. These platforms are in the air and far apart, but can be accessed by teleporting between the moving platforms with an {{Item|Aspect of the Leech}}. 

The further-in platforms move faster, but at the final platform, an {{Item|Enigma Soul}} can be found.

